            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahimasa wakela dî, wakambila mukelenge ne, Malu onso adi talalâ. Wakatua mpala wandi hanshi ku mesu kua mukelenge, wakamba ne, Yehowa, Nzambi webe, wakafila bantu bakatombokela mukelenge mu bianza bia mukelenge, avudishibue disanka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wakamuebesha ne, Nsongalume Abashaloma udi talalâ, anyi? Ahimasa wakakudimuna ne, Hakatuma Yoaba muntu webe kûdi, nakunvua diyoyo dinene, kadi tshiakamanya muakadi bualu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wakamba ne, Semena, wimane aha. Yeye wakasemena, wakimana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Monai, Muena Kushi wakafika; Muena Kushi wakamba ne, Ndi ne lumu lua kuambila mukelenge, bualu bua Yehowa wakakusombuela lelu kudi bonso bakabika bua kukutombokela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wakebesha Muena Kushi ne, Nsongalume Abashaloma udi talalâ, anyi? Muena Kushi wakamukudimuna ne, Bena lukuna ba mukelenge wanyi ne bonso bakabika bua kukuenzela bibi bikale bu nsongalume au. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanyinganyinga kakole kakakuata mukelenge, yeye wakabanda ku nsubu wakadi ku mutu kua tshibi, wakadila; hakadiye uya, wakamba ne, Muanʼanyi Abashaloma, muanʼanyi, muanʼanyi Abashaloma! Meme nakadi kukufuila, Abashaloma, muanʼanyi, muanʼanyi!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
